Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f9883422-3792-3c5a-8d1a-045984ba83a8.xml</text>
